! C2H4 + HO2 (P1) -> CH2CH2OOH (W2) -> OH + oxirane (P2), the HO2 + C2H4 sub-network of the C2H5 + O2 example of
! the MESS distribution (Examples/test_c2h5o2/test_c2h5o2.inp): wells, barriers and fragments copied unchanged,
! with three hindered rotors in W2 and two in each barrier. Temperatures and pressures reduced; output
! precision raised to 6 digits (OutPrecision, LogPrecision).
TemperatureList[K]                 300 500 700 1000 1500 2000
PressureList[bar]                  0.01 0.1 1. 10. 100.
EnergyStepOverTemperature		.2
ExcessEnergyOverTemperature		40
ModelEnergyLimit[kcal/mol]		400
CalculationMethod			direct
WellCutoff				10
ChemicalEigenvalueMax			0.2
OutPrecision				6
LogPrecision				6
